[finding] f-003 The sterile-nu server cannot directly test the 2507.18752 claim. Its SF mode caps lepton_asymmetry at 0.1 (the paper needs L >~ 0.5), its SF Delta N_eff is a he
**Finding:** The sterile-nu server cannot directly test the 2507.18752 claim. Its SF mode caps lepton_asymmetry at 0.1 (the paper needs L >~ 0.5), its SF Delta N_eff is a heuristic (0.1 x the DW value), and the asymmetry is not fed into the BBN network. At m_s = 10, 20, 30 keV with sin^2(2theta) = 1e-14 it gives Delta N_eff ~ 1e-8 and BBN Delta chi^2 = 0 (allowed). At 20 keV the outputs are Yp = 0.24682 and D/H = 2.4433e-5. Its SF Omega_s h^2 values are 0.122, 0.490, 1.10 for L = 1e-3 and 1.22, 4.90, 11.0 for L = 0.1 (10x larger for 100x larger L). All of these points are flagged as overclosing.
